### 4.3 消融

**（a）扩散策略 vs CVAE、BC vs Q（表 2，仅 3 个 Gym medium-expert 任务）**【原文 p.9 表 2】

| 方法 | halfcheetah-me | hopper-me | walker2d-me | 平均 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| BC-CVAE | 67.3 ± 7.4 | 69.9 ± 8.6 | 102.5 ± 4.4 | 79.9 |
| BC-Diffusion | 76.6 ± 7.0 | 78.0 ± 8.9 | 103.1 ± 4.4 | 85.9 |
| BCQ-CVAE | 96.1 ± 0.5 | 108.5 ± 0.6 | 110.7 ± 0.2 | 105.1 |
| BCQ-Diffusion | 94.6 ± 1.0 | 109.3 ± 0.9 | **114.0 ± 0.5** | 106.0 |
| CVAE-QL | 70.3 ± 5.5 | 109.2 ± 4.6 | 50.5 ± 38.2 | 76.6 |
| **Diffusion-QL** | **97.2 ± 0.4** | **112.3 ± 0.8** | 111.2 ± 0.9 | **106.9** |

